      "message": "This code assumes that all files matching a given pattern are actually to be considered as KMI symbol lists. While that is mostly true, the authoritative list is in BUILD.bazel (kmi_symbol_list + additional_kmi_symbol_lists). The union of all symbol lists is passed as an argument to `CONFIG_UNUSED_KSYMS_WHITELIST` and should be accessible here.\n\nVery likely this also creates a better input as the raw list is deduplicated and does not need postprocessing from `gen_gki_modules_headers.sh`\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:build/kernel/kleaf/impl/kernel_config.bzl;l\u003d185",
